Subject: [PATCH 00920/11362] [operator] add SOPS-encrypted registered
 ARC_API_KEY for ARC-AGI-3 competition
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Operator's registered ARC_API_KEY (from arcprize.org/platform) encrypted to
secrets/arc_api.enc.yaml via the project age key. Smoke-tested live: 25 environments
fetched, NO anonymous-key issued (authenticates as the registered key), scorecard opened
(official scoring path works). Together with secrets/kaggle.enc.yaml this fully credentials
the project for ARC Prize 2026 ARC-AGI-3 — competition-scored agent runs now possible.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
